{"ID":"20261001212411-4nm0zyo","Spec":"5","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-4nm0zyo","title":"力扣热题100","type":"doc","updated":"20261002164038"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261001212411-csljssr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-csljssr","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"力扣热题 100 · C++ 题解笔记"}]},{"ID":"20261001212411-l0g90or","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-l0g90or","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20261001212411-idsg3bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-idsg3bq","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"依据力扣官方学习计划「LeetCode 热题 100」整理，共 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17 个分类、100 道题"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每题包含：编号与难度、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"题目描述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一段话核心思路"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"带通俗注释的 C++ 代码"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20261001212411-z2jdvn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-z2jdvn0","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说明：代码采用力扣提交格式（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"class Solution"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），直接粘贴到力扣即可通过；若想在本地编译，请自行加上 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"#include \u0026lt;bits/stdc++.h\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"using namespace std;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并按题目要求定义 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ListNode"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"TreeNode"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Node"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等结构。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261001212411-ml5o6vy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-ml5o6vy","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目录"}]},{"ID":"20261001212411-bn8c0bm","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 序号 | 分类 | 题数 | 题目 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 哈希 | 3 | 两数之和、字母异位词分组、最长连续序列 |\n| 2 | 双指针 | 4 | 移动零、盛最多水的容器、三数之和、接雨水 |\n| 3 | 滑动窗口 | 2 | 无重复字符的最长子串、找到字符串中所有字母异位词 |\n| 4 | 子串 | 3 | 和为 K 的子数组、滑动窗口最大值、最小覆盖子串 |\n| 5 | 普通数组 | 5 | 最大子数组和、合并区间、轮转数组、除了自身以外数组的乘积、缺失的第一个正数 |\n| 6 | 矩阵 | 4 | 矩阵置零、螺旋矩阵、旋转图像、搜索二维矩阵 II |\n| 7 | 链表 | 14 | 相交链表 ~ LRU 缓存 |\n| 8 | 二叉树 | 15 | 中序遍历 ~ 二叉树中的最大路径和 |\n| 9 | 图论 | 4 | 岛屿数量、腐烂的橘子、课程表、实现 Trie |\n| 10 | 回溯 | 8 | 全排列、子集、电话号码的字母组合、组合总和、括号生成、单词搜索、分割回文串、N 皇后 |\n| 11 | 二分查找 | 6 | 搜索插入位置 ~ 寻找两个正序数组的中位数 |\n| 12 | 栈 | 5 | 有效的括号、最小栈、字符串解码、每日温度、柱状图中最大的矩形 |\n| 13 | 堆 | 3 | 数组中的第K个最大元素、前 K 个高频元素、数据流的中位数 |\n| 14 | 贪心算法 | 4 | 买卖股票的最佳时机、跳跃游戏、跳跃游戏 II、划分字母区间 |\n| 15 | 动态规划 | 10 | 爬楼梯 ~ 最长有效括号 |\n| 16 | 多维动态规划 | 5 | 不同路径、最小路径和、最长回文子串、最长公共子序列、编辑距离 |\n| 17 | 技巧 | 5 | 只出现一次的数字、多数元素、颜色分类、下一个排列、寻找重复数 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20261001212411-bn8c0bm","updated":"20261001212411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"序号"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分类"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题数"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题目"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTable